{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/differentiation-basics/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/differentiation-basics.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Differentiation Basics — Calculus","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Differentiation Basics</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/calculus/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">What's a derivative?</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted mt-2\">The derivative f'(x) gives the instantaneous rate of change or the gradient of the tangent at x. Power rule: d/dx[x^n] = n x^{n-1}.</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Visual — tangent &amp; slope</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 muted\">The tangent line touches the curve at a single point; its slope equals the derivative.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"420\" height=\"140\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fb7185\" stroke-width=\"2\" points=\"20,120 80,80 140,50 200,30 260,20 320,18 380,20\"></polyline>\n          <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"-10\" transform=\"translate(0,60)\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"></line>\n          <text x=\"30\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">Curve: example f(x)</text>\n          <text x=\"200\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">Tangent at x</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Worked examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 muted\">\n        <li>If f(x)=x^3, f'(x)=3x^2. At x=2, f'(2)=12.</li>\n        <li>Power rule: d/dx[5x^4]=20x^3.</li>\n        <li>Product rule example: y = x^2(x+1). y' = x^2·1 + 2x·(x+1) = 3x^2 + 2x.</li>\n        <li>Higher-order derivative: for f(x)=x^4, f'(x)=4x^3, f''(x)=12x^2.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">1) Differentiate y = 5x^4</div>\n          <input id=\"d1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 20x^3\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"dc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"dh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"dfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">2) y = x^2 + 3x. Find y' at x=1</div>\n          <input id=\"d2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 5\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"dc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"dh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"dfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"dQuiz\" class=\"bg-rose-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quick Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"dModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"dContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"dClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-rose-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .muted{color:#374151}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}